      "role": "user",
      "content": "Valid Parentheses\n\nGiven a string s containing just the characters '()', '{}' and '[]', determine if the input string is valid: open brackets must be closed by the same type in the correct order, and every close bracket has a matching open.\n\nExample: s = '([{}])' -> true; s = '(]' -> false.\nConstraints: 1 <= len(s) <= 10^4.",
      "id": "m-1",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-06T20:27:57.879Z",
      "durationMs": 0
    },
